{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202140","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1120214001:1":{"text":"戦いを始める前に……俺は自分が、父上にとって最も誇れる子どもだと思ってた。","source_cn":"在这场决斗之前，我一直以为我是父亲最引以为傲的孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEE27C6E1B89B9A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120214002:1":{"text":"だが、父上の捨て子であるお前に負けるなんて……","source_cn":"没想到，我竟然会输你，被遗弃的奥格之子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF90D7B52B20A22A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120214003:1":{"text":"お前が戦歌祭で勝ったのは、運がよかったからじゃなかったんだな。","source_cn":"原来，你获得战歌节的胜者之名并非幸运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B57685082ED1F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120214004:1":{"text":"……お前！","source_cn":"……你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38225042382EA62A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120214005:1":{"text":"待って、僕の聞き間違いだよね？ソーンが……オルグさんの息子？","source_cn":"等等，我没听错吧？索恩是……奥格的儿子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98A2F059CB032CCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120214006:1":{"text":"なんだ、お前たちは知らなかったのか？","source_cn":"原来你的同伴们还不知道这件事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96A48F80A7CC4BA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120214007:1":{"text":"ソーンは俺の兄弟であり、父上の息子だ。だがこいつはあまりに貧弱で、砂漠に捨てられたんだ。","source_cn":"索恩是我的兄弟，也是父亲的儿子。但因为他出生时太过孱弱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF268AE278683AC3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120214008:1":{"text":"族長の息子でも、弱ければ捨てられる。それが俺たちブラックロアーの生き方だ。","source_cn":"即使是族长之子，弱小也依然会被丢弃。这就是我们黑嚎氏族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0F4F271F3324C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120214009:1":{"text":"……よく淡々とそんな恐ろしい話ができるな？","source_cn":"……你是怎么做到用如此稀疏平常的语气，说出这么可怕的话的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x992CCDC29C404866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120214010:1":{"text":"ブラックロアーに人情なんてなくて、実力がものを言う。お前たちはいつもそうやって勝手に他人の強さを計るんだ。","source_cn":"毫无人情，只论实力的黑嚎氏族。你们总是擅自给别人打下强...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282E770D899FABA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120214011:1":{"text":"かつての「弱者」が自らの力で強くなると、お前たちは態度を一変させて仲間に引き入れようとする……","source_cn":"而在看到昔日的“弱者”凭借自身的力量变强之后，你们又一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC355401288FD8069","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120214012:1":{"text":"まったく馬鹿馬鹿しい！こんなところにはうんざりだ！","source_cn":"真是太可笑了，我要离开这里!","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF331BF656B890D06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:库金":{"text":"クージン","source":"库金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"ソーン","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"アルサ","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}